            "likes": 19,
            "saves": 2,
            "views": 329,
            "author": "calebgbtherealtor",
            "region": "US",
            "shares": 0,
            "caption": "I’ve been using AI to roleplay cold calls, and it’s lowkey changing my game 📞🤖 Instead of practicing on real leads and burning them, I have AI play the homeowner: the objections, the “we’re not interested,” the awkward pauses, all of it. I get to run the same call 20 times, try different responses, and figure out what actually works before I ever pick up the phone for real. Reps are reps. The agents who convert aren’t lucky, they’ve just had the hard conversations a hundred times before it counted. If you’re in sales or real estate, steal this 🤝 and if you’re thinking about buying or selling on the Space Coast, just know your agent is the type to practice at 10pm to get it right. Caleb · Century 21 Baytree Realty #sales #coldcalling #realestate #brevardcountyflorida #spacecoast ",
